            ^"Appearance" STRING "Maris is a gruff, weathered man of Nordic descent. He keeps himself in a practical, maintainable appearance, with hair uncut, and often with a month or more growth of beard."
            ^"Sigil" STRING "When Maris casts a spell, he grasps at ethereal threads connecting him to his target, weaving them into a desired effect. His voting token is a snowflake bound in a spiral."
            ^"Source" STRING "Magi of Hermes"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 70
        }
    }

