            ^"Appearance" STRING "Maris, now beginning to feel the effects of age, is starting to look a bit thin. Years on the sea have taken their toll, weathering Maris’ skin to almost resemble the stony shore."
            ^"Activities in the last 15 Years" STRING "After his last encounter with Natura, Maris was left scornful and angered. After spending longer than he ever had on the island, he once again ventured forth, swearing never to return. He used the Paregro Mare to seed underwater gardens for food supplies, and new items were forged and spells invented. The great plan had finally come together. Maris did set sail from Slvolder on the first day of the new year 1300. Maris has since been lost to the Order, without a single sighting of his ship in recent memory."
            ^"Source" STRING "Magi of Hermes"
            ^"Page" INTEGER 74
